menu "BhumiPulse LoRa Configuration"
    config BHUMIPULSE_ROLE_GATEWAY
        bool "Compile shared RF stack for BhumiPulse Gateway (Master)"
        default n
        help
            Enables Gateway-only hooks such as Alive Table updates on relay collapse.
            Leave disabled (n) for BhumiPulse_Node builds.

    config BHUMIPULSE_LORA_TX_POWER
        int "Default LoRa TX Power (dBm, PA_BOOST)"
        range 2 20
        default 14
        help
            Use 14 dBm for bench/close-range testing to prevent SX1276 saturation,
            and up to 20 dBm for long-range field deployment.
endmenu